{"id":"vod_sn_36248","vodId":"36248","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"弑神者！","name_cn":"弑神者！","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0f2076ca6ccec41430847b8b62fc42b8.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个神灵真实存在的世界，正如神话中所流传的那样，诸神在各自的领域中发挥着不同的作用。但是，逐渐的，有一些邪恶的神开始无法安分守己，他们的欲望和权利想要的到伸张，也会带来毁灭性的灾难。于是，一些有特殊能力能够杀死神灵的少年和少女们出现了，我们称他们为弑神者。　　草薙护堂（松冈祯丞 配音）是一个普通的高中生，一次偶然中，他打败了军神继承了他的能力，从此，一条弑神的道路在护堂面前展开了。与此同时，少女艾丽卡（日笠阳子 配音）、巫女万里谷祐理（花泽香菜 配音）、艾丽卡的好友利利亚娜（喜多村英梨 配音）等人也都逐渐发现了自己的能力，随着战斗的深入，他们发现，单打独斗绝非正道，只有团结起来，利用优势隐藏劣势，才有可能战胜那最后的，最可怕的，也是最强大的敌人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":17,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HFQZ1JXSsH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3970VxEDTS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pQws6AZnUx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fpVed984xE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hNmrNatsG01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ws7ifx1KLT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J8SfNtL3tV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CrRpHT39JE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NpTnnSWz7i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mzR4WX7Rvq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WrzGntkvSZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eYgCvkmC9M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yd4k9gQLTe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ljdt